16. Alert Architecture

Sentinel NER produces a governed alert object.

Risk / event
    -> consequence
    -> recommendation
    -> human authorization
    -> CAP-compatible alert
    -> external dissemination adapter

Potential adapters:

C-DOT/SACHET where authorized and available;

SMS/provider;

push;

email;

IVR/voice;

field channels.

Keep provider-specific logic behind adapters.

17. Multilingual Layer

Use a provider abstraction for Indian-language translation/speech capabilities, with Bhashini as a possible integration where approved/available.

Important rules:

AI-generated alert text must be reviewable;

language must be explicitly selected;

translation failure must not silently send the wrong language;

original authoritative text must be retained.

