21. Warning Ledger

Use MongoDB append-only records with a chained hash.

Concept:

Event 001
hash = A

Event 002
previousHash = A
hash = B

Event 003
previousHash = B
hash = C

The ledger should preserve enough data to reconstruct:

prediction;

recommendation;

authorization;

alert;

acknowledgement;

action;

outcome.

Do not use blockchain unless a concrete governance requirement exists.

