26. Performance Targets

Targets are to be measured, not assumed.

Initial engineering goals:

fast first meaningful interface load on constrained networks;

bounded API response times for common dashboard operations;

map queries must use appropriate spatial indexes;

heavy raster/ML jobs asynchronous;

no full-dataset transfers to browsers;

large tables virtualized/paginated.

Final SLOs should be set after realistic load testing.

